**Security**

Traffic between the app and the game server is sent over an encrypted connection (HTTPS), and leaderboard responses are additionally encrypted with AES-256-GCM. I value your trust in providing us your Personal Information, thus we are striving to use commercially acceptable means of protecting it. But remember that no method of transmission over the internet, or method of electronic storage is 100% secure and reliable, and I cannot guarantee its absolute security.

Please note that the leaderboard is social rather than competitive: signing in carries no password, so a name is held by whoever claimed it first and scores cannot be guaranteed to be genuine. Treat the board as entertainment, and keep anything you would not want to be public out of your player name.

